  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to Disability-Inclusive Health, Protection, and Humanitarian Logistics Services for War-Affected Populations.</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">FCDO will support H&amp;I to improve access to rehabilitation, mental health and psychosocial support, assistive devices, and referral services for conflict-affected people with injuries, disabilities, and functional limitations in the Gaza Strip and the West Bank. It will strengthen the capacity of local service providers and humanitarian actors to deliver more inclusive and accessible assistance, while supporting disability-inclusive data, coordination, and planning. The project will also provide shared logistics services to help humanitarian organisations maintain the delivery of essential assistance to affected communities.</narrative>
  </description>
